2026-09-23T07:02:32.0642420Z     The ``pytest`` framework makes it easy to write small tests, yet
2026-09-23T07:02:32.0642911Z     scales to support complex functional testing for applications and libraries.
2026-09-23T07:02:32.0643313Z     
2026-09-23T07:02:32.0643518Z     An example of a simple test:
2026-09-23T07:02:32.0643765Z     
